  m_text: This is a sotry about a dwarf \n who slowly leans about magic due to a
    ill incident which happened during an expadition\n\n He was traveling with his
    party back from an expadition at which point he gets ambused and captured...\n
    he is then prisioned for days with no contact to any form of creatures and provided
    food bed and fire for comfort\n\n seeing how odd the situtaion is our little
    hero is determined to find the truth of this place...\n little did he know thata
    dwarf who only knew to hold axe is about to dive deep into world of magic and
    shadows...
